<section image-layout="blank" id="_Np8jQTVbx"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="m8DqskFA_p"><p role="eyebrow">Operating modes</p><h2>Two loops. Two outcomes.</h2><p>Match the loop to what is known.</p><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="_80yDR2fOI" background-color="surface" padding="10pt 18pt" rowspan="24"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="HZMEzy_ZFf" colspan="14"><p role="eyebrow">Production loop</p><h3>Known target</h3><p role="caption">Repeat protects fidelity.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="TX630WeWOQ" colspan="46"><grid marker="number" marker-size="large" marker-style="subtle" marker-shape="chevron" marker-position="above" marker-align="center" marker-fill="true" spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug" padding="1em" style="--marker-chip-padding: 0.75em;"><grid-item id="FyQ9r03SmP" colspan="15"><h4>Define</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="1J3j5Kaq_N" colspan="15"><h4>Execute</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="r9xDs13weO" colspan="15"><h4>Verify</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="3_kooOjzu6" colspan="15"><h4>Repeat</h4></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="MfmlklHZc0" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 18pt" rowspan="24"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="Ww8Rd_EfkT" colspan="14"><p role="eyebrow">Discovery loop</p><h3><span text-color="accent">Open question</span></h3><p role="caption">Learning changes the frame.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="aluszlnQ3J" colspan="46"><grid marker="number" marker-size="large" marker-style="subtle" marker-shape="chevron" marker-position="above" marker-align="center" marker-fill="true" spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug" padding="1em" style="--marker-chip-padding: 0.75em;"><grid-item id="Tk58RZVMNd" colspan="12"><h4>Frame</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="bLr9GUChm5" colspan="12"><h4>Vary</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="aWxTqS-T0V" colspan="12"><h4>Notice</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="Um5WVKVy7O" colspan="12"><h4>Select</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="ecyeQbahqP" colspan="12"><h4>Learn</h4></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="iYA9ydr-sW" background-color="accent" padding="8pt 18pt" rowspan="12"><h4>Known destination: reduce variation. Unknown destination: create informative variation.</h4></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>